                        "entry_id": "e482a3be-9fec-3988-a0b3-028c701a2df4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A chief or lord."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c31a340b-a4a0-4202-b14d-fa1a9a9bc63d",
                                "sense_id": "50a1a939-b85d-33f2-bdb7-9aecf19a8aaf",
                                "text": "To tell of his deir weid war doutles delite,\n And alse ter for to tell the travalis war tight.\n His name and his nobillay wes noght for to nyte;\n Thair wes na hathill sa heich, be half ane fute hicht."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcf9e613-ecd9-43f7-8683-51071256dae7",
                                "sense_id": "50a1a939-b85d-33f2-bdb7-9aecf19a8aaf",
                                "text": "Proclamation in that place,\n was plainely declared,\n That every hatell should him hie,\n in hast that he might,\n To Bolton in Geldowre,\n all in godly haste."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
